<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts" xml:lang="zh-CN"><voice name="zh-CN-YunxiNeural"><bookmark mark="l0"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="-2%" pitch="0%">看一个<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">教学假设</prosody>：平常每周卖<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">一百箱</prosody>，这周卖了<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">一百二十箱</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l0-end"/><break time="200ms"/><bookmark mark="l1"/><mstts:express-as style="narration-relaxed" styledegree="0.8"><prosody rate="-1%" pitch="+1%">店主怕断货，向批发商订<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">一百六十箱</prosody>。批发商再补安全库存，向工厂订<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">两百四十箱</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l1-end"/><break time="200ms"/><bookmark mark="l2"/><mstts:express-as style="chat" styledegree="0.6"><prosody rate="-1%" pitch="0%">工厂又按旺季备货，计划做到<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">四百箱</prosody>。每层都觉得自己只加了一点，加在一起，<prosody rate="-3%" pitch="+1%">却变了样</prosody>。</prosody></mstts:express-as><bookmark mark="l2-end"/></voice></speak>